SUMMARY:Form 1120-S due for calendar-year 2026 S corporations
DESCRIPTION:File Form 1120-S or Form 7004 for an extension. Late penalty:
  $260 per shareholder per month\, up to 12 months.\n\nDetails: https://mf
 a-advisory.com/blog/llc-taxed-as-s-corp-guide/\nGeneral information\, not
  tax advice. Merchant Financial Advisory\, mfa-advisory.com
