SUMMARY:NJ: CBT-100S due (calendar-year 2026)
DESCRIPTION:New Jersey has no separate S election for periods beginning o
 n or after December 22\, 2022. Schedule SJC and proof of federal S status
  are filed with the return.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-advisory.com/blog/llc
